===Verb===
{{ru-verb|ве́рить|impf|pf=пове́рить}}

# to [[believe]], to [[trust]] {{+obj|ru|dat<someone>}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[я|Я]] [[ты|тебе́]] [[не]] '''ве́рю'''.|t=I don't believe you./I don't trust you.}}
